%% Phase2 / post / G-07 加急与确认
%% Helix owners: event/post/urgent.rs; channel/write/urgent.rs; ws/handlers/post_update.rs; port_reply/message_v3_urgent.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt requester sends urgent
    UI->>Gate: urgentPost({postId,targetIds})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_urgent_post", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
    E->>IM: parse command and authorize requester
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST urgent
    Host->>Go: urgent admission
    Go-->>Host: 2xx admission
    Go-->>WS: WS post_update.urgent(active,event_seq)
  else recipient confirms urgent
    UI->>Gate: urgentConfirm(postId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_urgent_confirm", {postId})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
    E->>IM: parse confirm and authorize recipient
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST urgent-confirm
    Host->>Go: confirm admission
    Go-->>Host: 2xx admission
    Go-->>WS: WS post_update.urgent(confirmed,event_seq)
  end
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_update)
  E->>IM: dispatch urgent authority
  alt next event_seq
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(message urgent state + cursor)
    Host->>DB: commit active/pending/completed and viewer facts
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet message/channel_member
    Host->>DB: readback requester/recipient absolute state
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:updated(expediteMap/confirmed)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update(viewer-local pending)
    Sink-->>UI: requester/recipient UI converges to authority state
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw post/channel events
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw post/channel events
  else duplicate or gap
    IM->>IM: duplicate no-op；gap enters continuity buffer
  end
  Note over UI,Web: urgent active/pending/completed 均来自 durable absolute state；HTTP accepted 不显示完成。
